WEBVTT

1
00:51:02.786 --> 00:51:09.786
Has everyone received a blessing? Raise your hand in front of my eyes if no one has prayed for you yet.

2
00:51:09.786 --> 00:51:11.786
You don't dare, do you?

3
00:51:11.786 --> 00:51:15.786
Martin, has no one prayed for you yet?

4
00:51:15.786 --> 00:51:20.786
Matthijs, would you please pray for Martin, behind you?

5
00:51:20.786 --> 00:51:23.786
Young lady, has no one prayed for you yet?

6
00:51:23.786 --> 00:51:31.786
Jesus, shiney, can you pray for the young lady?

7
00:51:31.786 --> 00:51:34.786
Is there anyone else for whom no one has prayed yet?

8
00:51:34.786 --> 00:51:38.786
Let us be in the house of prayer together.

9
00:51:38.786 --> 00:51:41.786
Has everyone been prayed for?

10
00:51:41.786 --> 00:51:43.786
That's good.

11
00:51:43.786 --> 00:51:45.786
Wonderful.

12
00:51:45.786 --> 00:51:48.786
We serve a good God, amen.

13
00:51:48.786 --> 00:51:51.786
Rise the Lord. Rise the Lord.

14
00:51:51.786 --> 00:51:55.786
Chris, may I invite you?

15
00:51:55.786 --> 00:52:00.786
Hold on a moment, I'm going to...

16
00:52:00.786 --> 00:52:03.786
Thank you, Chris.

17
00:52:07.786 --> 00:52:10.786
Thank you.

18
00:52:10.786 --> 00:52:13.786
Good morning.

19
00:52:13.786 --> 00:52:17.786
Let me keep everything on my phone this time.

20
00:52:17.786 --> 00:52:21.786
Hallelujah.

21
00:52:21.786 --> 00:52:27.786
Oh, worship. So important.

22
00:52:27.786 --> 00:52:31.786
Without worship, no life.

23
00:52:31.786 --> 00:52:33.786
That is also the text I have for today.

24
00:52:33.786 --> 00:52:38.786
If possible, if it can be on the screen, very nice.

25
00:52:38.786 --> 00:52:41.786
Mark 14, verses 3 to 9.

26
00:52:41.786 --> 00:52:44.786
And it says, when he was in Bethany in the house of Simon,

27
00:52:44.786 --> 00:52:47.786
the one who had suffered from leprosy, so he was already healed,

28
00:52:47.786 --> 00:52:51.786
was present at a feast, a woman came in.

29
00:52:51.786 --> 00:52:53.786
She had an alabaster jar with her,

30
00:52:53.786 --> 00:52:57.786
filled with very precious pure nard oil.

31
00:52:57.786 --> 00:53:03.786
And she broke the jar and poured the oil over his head, over Jesus' head.

32
00:53:03.786 --> 00:53:06.786
And some of the attendees said irritated to each other,

33
00:53:06.786 --> 00:53:09.786
what is this waste for?

34
00:53:09.786 --> 00:53:13.786
That oil could have been sold for more than 300 denarii,

35
00:53:13.786 --> 00:53:15.786
and that money could have been given to the poor.

36
00:53:15.786 --> 00:53:19.786
So about a year's salary.

37
00:53:19.786 --> 00:53:23.786
They spoke harshly against her, they began to act ugly towards that woman.

38
00:53:23.786 --> 00:53:25.786
But Jesus said, let her alone.

39
00:53:25.786 --> 00:53:27.786
Why are you bothering her?

40
00:53:27.786 --> 00:53:29.786
She has done something good for me.

41
00:53:29.786 --> 00:53:32.786
For the poor will always be with you,

42
00:53:32.786 --> 00:53:35.786
and you can prove this to them whenever you want.

43
00:53:35.786 --> 00:53:38.786
But I will not always be with you.

44
00:53:38.786 --> 00:53:41.786
What she could do, she has done.

45
00:53:41.786 --> 00:53:44.786
She has already anointed my body with oil,

46
00:53:44.786 --> 00:53:47.786
in preparation for my burial.

47
00:53:47.786 --> 00:53:52.786
I assure you, wherever in the world the good news is proclaimed,

48
00:53:52.786 --> 00:53:56.786
what she has done will be told in memory of her.

49
00:53:56.786 --> 00:53:59.786
Hereby.

50
00:53:59.786 --> 00:54:01.786
Why this text?

51
00:54:01.786 --> 00:54:04.786
For the return of our gifts.

52
00:54:04.786 --> 00:54:08.786
It is very good to return.

53
00:54:08.786 --> 00:54:11.786
It is also very good to practice financial stewardship.

54
00:54:11.786 --> 00:54:13.786
That is super important.

55
00:54:13.786 --> 00:54:16.786
That is good and that is right.

56
00:54:17.786 --> 00:54:20.786
But when you do things like stewardship,

57
00:54:20.786 --> 00:54:22.786
it can also become a routine.

58
00:54:22.786 --> 00:54:24.786
It can also become a tradition.

59
00:54:24.786 --> 00:54:27.786
It can even become something you hold on to very tightly.

60
00:54:29.786 --> 00:54:32.786
And when we look at...

61
00:54:32.786 --> 00:54:36.786
What Maria, that's her name, poured out over Jesus,

62
00:54:36.786 --> 00:54:38.786
was simply a year's salary.

63
00:54:38.786 --> 00:54:40.786
Then you think, yes...

64
00:54:40.786 --> 00:54:43.786
We could have put that money in the building fund.

65
00:54:44.786 --> 00:54:48.786
But that's not how it works with Jesus.

66
00:54:48.786 --> 00:54:51.786
In any case, it was a prophetic act that she did.

67
00:54:51.786 --> 00:54:53.786
But aside from that, her heart.

68
00:54:53.786 --> 00:54:55.786
What was with her heart?

69
00:54:55.786 --> 00:54:57.786
Her heart was full of Jesus.

70
00:54:57.786 --> 00:54:59.786
Full of gratitude for Jesus.

71
00:54:59.786 --> 00:55:03.786
And this is the heart with which we may return.

72
00:55:03.786 --> 00:55:06.786
This is the heart of gratitude.

73
00:55:06.786 --> 00:55:09.786
With which we may give.

74
00:55:09.786 --> 00:55:12.786
And it is also the question of, when we return,

75
00:55:12.786 --> 00:55:15.786
do we return in worship?

76
00:55:15.786 --> 00:55:20.786
I just said, a day without worship is actually just a day without life.

77
00:55:21.786 --> 00:55:23.786
But it is really so necessary,

78
00:55:23.786 --> 00:55:27.786
that we come to Jesus with such a heart.

79
00:55:28.786 --> 00:55:31.786
And the beautiful thing about that is,

80
00:55:31.786 --> 00:55:36.786
I also think that worship is something we were created for.

81
00:55:36.786 --> 00:55:38.786
What we are made for.

82
00:55:38.786 --> 00:55:41.786
And then every act of our life may be worship.

83
00:55:42.786 --> 00:55:47.786
So if you practice good stewardship, it is actually also worship.

84
00:55:47.786 --> 00:55:51.786
But if your heart is not in it, that is a pity.

85
00:55:52.786 --> 00:55:55.786
And He wants, Jesus wants, God wants.

86
00:55:55.786 --> 00:55:58.786
What does God really want?

87
00:55:58.786 --> 00:56:00.786
That is your heart.

88
00:56:00.786 --> 00:56:02.786
When we come to Him in full surrender.

89
00:56:02.786 --> 00:56:04.786
When we stand before Him in full surrender.

90
00:56:04.786 --> 00:56:07.786
He is not concerned about that gift.

91
00:56:07.786 --> 00:56:09.786
He is not concerned about that offering.

92
00:56:09.786 --> 00:56:11.786
He is not concerned about that offering.

93
00:56:11.786 --> 00:56:13.786
He is concerned about your heart.

94
00:56:13.786 --> 00:56:16.786
He wants us, in true worship,

95
00:56:16.786 --> 00:56:21.786
to anchor ourselves in full surrender in His covenant.

96
00:56:21.786 --> 00:56:23.786
In His relationship with us.

97
00:56:23.786 --> 00:56:25.786
How beautiful is that?

98
00:56:25.786 --> 00:56:27.786
And then you will also bring it back.

99
00:56:27.786 --> 00:56:29.786
Do not see it as an obligation.

100
00:56:29.786 --> 00:56:33.786
Or as something that, yes, that is just part of it.

101
00:56:33.786 --> 00:56:35.786
No, it is actually an opportunity.

102
00:56:35.786 --> 00:56:37.786
It is a really beautiful opportunity.

103
00:56:37.786 --> 00:56:40.786
To show God that you love Him.

104
00:56:40.786 --> 00:56:44.786
That you are grateful for everything you have received from Him.

105
00:56:44.786 --> 00:56:46.786
That price which was priceless.

106
00:56:46.786 --> 00:56:48.786
That He paid for us.

107
00:56:48.786 --> 00:56:50.786
For you and for me.

108
00:56:50.786 --> 00:56:52.786
And as we may bring it back.

109
00:56:52.786 --> 00:56:55.786
It is of course important that things are arranged.

110
00:56:55.786 --> 00:56:57.786
Things are organized.

111
00:56:57.786 --> 00:56:59.786
And we are also very happy with the building team.

112
00:56:59.786 --> 00:57:02.786
That really pays close attention to the finances.

113
00:57:02.786 --> 00:57:04.786
So that building can also take place.

114
00:57:04.786 --> 00:57:07.786
But please, as we bring it back.

115
00:57:07.786 --> 00:57:09.786
And also as we sow.

116
00:57:09.786 --> 00:57:11.786
Whether it is for daily things.

117
00:57:11.786 --> 00:57:12.786
Or for the building fund.

118
00:57:12.786 --> 00:57:14.786
Please let us hold on to this heart.

119
00:57:14.786 --> 00:57:16.786
The heart of Mary, as we bring it back.

120
00:57:16.786 --> 00:57:18.786
Maybe it is nice to stand up.

121
00:57:18.786 --> 00:57:20.786
And also to show gratitude to God.

122
00:57:20.786 --> 00:57:22.786
So if you give this morning.

123
00:57:22.786 --> 00:57:24.786
Maybe hold your hand on your heart.

124
00:57:24.786 --> 00:57:25.786
Or do something.

125
00:57:25.786 --> 00:57:28.786
Something that shows you are grateful for Jesus.

126
00:57:28.786 --> 00:57:30.786
Father, thank you.

127
00:57:30.786 --> 00:57:31.786
In this, God is present.

128
00:57:31.786 --> 00:57:32.786
In this, the Most High is present.

129
00:57:32.786 --> 00:57:34.786
In this, the name above every name is present.

130
00:57:34.786 --> 00:57:36.786
In this, the love that you had for us.

131
00:57:36.786 --> 00:57:37.786
That went so far.

132
00:57:37.786 --> 00:57:40.786
In this, that you gave your life.

133
00:57:40.786 --> 00:57:43.786
We cannot comprehend that.

134
00:57:43.786 --> 00:57:46.786
In this, you have completely set us free.

135
00:57:46.786 --> 00:57:49.786
From every sickness, sin, misery, death, and everything.

136
00:57:49.786 --> 00:57:51.786
In this, that price could only be paid.

137
00:57:51.786 --> 00:57:54.786
And this was your love.

138
00:57:54.786 --> 00:57:56.786
And I thank you that we may stand here.

139
00:57:56.786 --> 00:57:58.786
And I also pray for Openkerk.

140
00:57:58.786 --> 00:58:01.786
That we may always respond to your love.

141
00:58:01.786 --> 00:58:07.786
And even though it is sometimes looked at strangely by human eyes.

142
00:58:07.786 --> 00:58:09.786
That doesn't matter.

143
00:58:09.786 --> 00:58:12.786
That we can just go all out for you.

144
00:58:12.786 --> 00:58:14.786
And that we can lay our hearts on the table before you, Lord.

145
00:58:14.786 --> 00:58:15.786
In the name of King Jesus.

146
00:58:15.786 --> 00:58:18.786
And I thank you that you do this in Jesus' name.

147
00:58:18.786 --> 00:58:19.786
Amen.

148
00:58:26.786 --> 00:58:27.786
Yes.

149
00:58:28.786 --> 00:58:32.786
I just quickly went to the toilet.

150
00:58:32.786 --> 00:58:34.786
And then I saw such a young guy.

151
00:58:34.786 --> 00:58:37.786
And I said, you are the son of Jeroen Elfrink, right?

152
00:58:37.786 --> 00:58:38.786
And he said, yes.

153
00:58:38.786 --> 00:58:40.786
I said, I haven't seen your father at all.

154
00:58:40.786 --> 00:58:41.786
He said, he is here.

155
00:58:41.786 --> 00:58:44.786
I said, then I should hear him soon.

156
00:58:44.786 --> 00:58:48.786
Jeroen, please come forward quickly.

157
00:58:48.786 --> 00:58:52.786
Jeroen is our brother in the congregation.

158
00:58:52.786 --> 00:58:55.786
And he is a missionary for God's kingdom.

159
00:58:55.786 --> 00:58:58.786
He is out more often than he is at home.

160
00:58:58.786 --> 00:59:03.786
But a church cannot be counted by its seating capacity.

161
00:59:03.786 --> 00:59:07.786
But a church is recognized by its sending capacity.

162
00:59:07.786 --> 00:59:11.786
That if you believe in God, have a relationship with Jesus.

163
00:59:11.786 --> 00:59:13.786
And go out.

164
00:59:13.786 --> 00:59:14.786
That can be here.

165
00:59:14.786 --> 00:59:16.786
That can be in your area.

166
00:59:16.786 --> 00:59:18.786
That can also be worldwide.

167
00:59:18.786 --> 00:59:21.786
Only when you go out for Jesus, have you become an apostle for Jesus.

168
00:59:21.786 --> 00:59:23.786
We are all disciples.

169
00:59:23.786 --> 00:59:25.786
But we ultimately also need to go out.

170
00:59:25.786 --> 00:59:26.786
Go forth, says God.

171
00:59:26.786 --> 00:59:27.786
Hallelujah.

172
00:59:27.786 --> 00:59:28.786
Jeroen, jump for a moment.

173
00:59:28.786 --> 00:59:30.786
Do a somersault on the stage.

174
00:59:32.786 --> 00:59:35.786
I enjoy sharing testimonies from time to time.

175
00:59:35.786 --> 00:59:38.786
So take a couple of minutes to share what has been on your mind the last few weeks.

176
00:59:40.786 --> 00:59:43.786
We have actually been very busy in Moldova for the last few weeks.

177
00:59:43.786 --> 00:59:46.786
And this week we get to go there again.

178
00:59:46.786 --> 00:59:48.786
To bring a piece of teaching.

179
00:59:48.786 --> 00:59:51.786
The last time we were there, I was with Anja.

180
00:59:51.786 --> 00:59:54.786
And God has worked so powerfully in prophetic words.

181
00:59:54.786 --> 00:59:55.786
That is just not normal.

182
00:59:55.786 --> 00:59:57.786
I am also surprised by that myself.

183
00:59:57.786 --> 01:00:00.786
And when you talk about a path, it touches me.

184
01:00:00.786 --> 01:00:03.786
There was a pastor who was about to give up.

185
01:00:03.786 --> 01:00:06.786
He says, my hands are dropping down, like Aaron and Moses.

186
01:00:06.786 --> 01:00:13.786
But he says, you spoke such a specific word that you could not know.

187
01:00:13.786 --> 01:00:17.786
He says, it touched me so much that I know exactly what I need to do.

188
01:00:17.786 --> 01:00:22.786
And that is actually what we do a lot in those kinds of countries.

189
01:00:22.786 --> 01:00:24.786
Also in Ukraine.

190
01:00:24.786 --> 01:00:27.786
Where we really speak to people from the Holy Spirit.

191
01:00:27.786 --> 01:00:29.786
To try to encourage and touch them.

192
01:00:29.786 --> 01:00:32.786
There was a woman who came forward.

193
01:00:32.786 --> 01:00:33.786
Also for prayer.

194
01:00:33.786 --> 01:00:37.786
And God says, I am already old. I don't know what to do anymore.

195
01:00:38.786 --> 01:00:40.786
And I want you to give me a word.

196
01:00:40.786 --> 01:00:43.786
Well, that doesn't put any pressure on you, of course.

197
01:00:44.786 --> 01:00:47.786
So I say, okay, we are going to pray. Let's see what God says.

198
01:00:47.786 --> 01:00:49.786
And we started to pray and God gave me a vision.

199
01:00:49.786 --> 01:00:52.786
And I saw her walking around with cookies in a hospital.

200
01:00:52.786 --> 01:00:53.786
And talking to people.

201
01:00:53.786 --> 01:00:55.786
And I say, yes, it's not about those cookies.

202
01:00:55.786 --> 01:00:58.786
But I think God wants to place you among those people.

203
01:00:58.786 --> 01:01:00.786
Who are having a really hard time in a hospital.

204
01:01:00.786 --> 01:01:02.786
And who are sick or maybe on their deathbed.

205
01:01:02.786 --> 01:01:05.786
To show them the hope and love of Jesus Christ.

206
01:01:05.786 --> 01:01:08.786
And I say, say that to you.

207
01:01:08.786 --> 01:01:10.786
And she says, with those eyes full of pride.

208
01:01:10.786 --> 01:01:13.786
Tell them, this is what I want. This is in my heart.

209
01:01:13.786 --> 01:01:17.786
Yes, and then I am so surprised actually.

210
01:01:17.786 --> 01:01:19.786
And you just talked about humility.

211
01:01:19.786 --> 01:01:21.786
But then I am so surprised.

212
01:01:21.786 --> 01:01:24.786
Every time again how God can speak through you.

213
01:01:24.786 --> 01:01:26.786
If you are just humble.

214
01:01:26.786 --> 01:01:28.786
And open to Him.

215
01:01:28.786 --> 01:01:31.786
And say, Father, you have to do it. We know nothing.

216
01:01:31.786 --> 01:01:34.786
But you know what is going on in all those people.

217
01:01:34.786 --> 01:01:36.786
And then He makes it known to you.

218
01:01:36.786 --> 01:01:38.786
And then you say exactly the right thing.

219
01:01:38.786 --> 01:01:41.786
In every church. We have had thirteen gatherings.

220
01:01:41.786 --> 01:01:43.786
Every church. I didn't know what to say.

221
01:01:43.786 --> 01:01:46.786
And I was flipping through all those sermons and lessons.

222
01:01:46.786 --> 01:01:49.786
And then the Holy Spirit said, you need to say this.

223
01:01:49.786 --> 01:01:51.786
And then I spoke a text.

224
01:01:51.786 --> 01:01:53.786
And then the Holy Spirit just began to speak.

225
01:01:53.786 --> 01:01:55.786
What those people needed.

226
01:01:55.786 --> 01:01:57.786
And then people come up to you afterwards.

227
01:01:57.786 --> 01:01:59.786
Not even for the prayer, but just to hug you.

228
01:01:59.786 --> 01:02:02.786
To say, thank you. Because this is exactly what we needed.

229
01:02:02.786 --> 01:02:04.786
And now we are going to open this church.

230
01:02:04.786 --> 01:02:07.786
And now we are going to Moldova again this week.

231
01:02:07.786 --> 01:02:09.786
And connecting to Ukraine.

232
01:02:09.786 --> 01:02:12.786
Then we are going to bring God's Word there again.

233
01:02:12.786 --> 01:02:15.786
Encourage people. Pray with those who need it.

234
01:02:15.786 --> 01:02:18.786
And they need it. Because they have almost no power there.

235
01:02:18.786 --> 01:02:21.786
In Odessa where we are. Three hours of power a day.

236
01:02:21.786 --> 01:02:22.786
With minus 17 degrees.

237
01:02:22.786 --> 01:02:27.786
Well, you can imagine what a delightful misery that is.

238
01:02:27.786 --> 01:02:29.786
What?

239
01:02:30.786 --> 01:02:33.786
Three hours of power. Minus 17 degrees.

240
01:02:33.786 --> 01:02:35.786
Means that you have no heating.

241
01:02:35.786 --> 01:02:37.786
Actually for three o'clock.

242
01:02:37.786 --> 01:02:40.786
But yes, when it's minus 17 degrees and your house is not very well insulated.

243
01:02:40.786 --> 01:02:42.786
Yes, yes.

244
01:02:42.786 --> 01:02:44.786
No. Exactly.

245
01:02:44.786 --> 01:02:49.786
The last thing is that we are working on preparing a training center in Romania.

246
